 customer is greater than our traditional real estate channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2019 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2020-02-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"In our Specialty Insurance segment, our home warranty business continues to deliver strong returns, driven by growth in our real estate and direct-to-consumer channels, combined with lower loss rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2019 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2020-02-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark E. Seaton","x":"Well, I would say that the direct-to-consumer, we didn't have one direct-to-consumer order 10 years ago and now a significant part of the business comes from direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2019 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2020-02-13","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"And we've probably been a little underweight in the direct-to-consumer which we put a large effort into '19 and that effort will continue into '20 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2019 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2020-02-13","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Hughes","x":"I wonder just a quick update on the Specialty Insurance, your direct-to-consumer initiatives, the mix of business there based on transactions versus renewals or that direct channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2019 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark E. Seaton","x":"So it's not an acquisition that we're going to create value by taking a lot of cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"With purchase transactions declining, we continue to focus on the direct-to-consumer channel as well as policy retention efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"Consistent with our people-first philosophy, we have committed to our employees that we will not make any layoffs through the end of the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Hughes","x":"Then final question, the no layoff, agreed, that sounds like a great policy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Gamaitoni","x":"I was wondering if any smaller agents, how they're dealing with the current stay-at-home orders, disruptions, who might not have nearly the investment capacity as you.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2020-07-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"Although, we have seen an increase in claim frequency this quarter, particularly in the appliance trade, which we attribute to the pandemic, our direct-to-consumer sales have been strong, leaving our initial outlook for 2020 unchanged.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2020-07-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark E. Seaton","x":"I think what's happening right now with home warranty is, yes, we're having more claims, especially appliances, because more people are at home, they are using their equipment more, but we're also doing a lot better than we were expecting on direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"During our last earnings call, we discussed the no layoff commitment we made to our employees at the end of June.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"Yeah, I think we absolutely made the right decision by the way on the new layoff policy for the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"FAF 2020 Q4","e":"faf","d":"2021-02-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"But the business is growing nicely both in our real estate channel and our direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2021-04-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark E. Seaton","x":"Importantly, revenue in our direct-to-consumer channel increased 18%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"Not really historically, but this nuances here what I'm saying, historically, we built plants because of cost of building on with the limited record layoffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/first-american-financial-corp-faf-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Campbell","x":"Is it the way to kind of frame-up the incremental revenue opportunity versus maybe just the potential production cost savings, anything you can provide there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/first-american-financial-corporation-faf-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Geoffrey Dunn","x":"Can people expect that a lot of these gains could be passed through to shareholders, particularly when you're talking about such big gains on these ventures?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/first-american-financial-corporation-faf-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis J. Gilmore","x":"We're not doing this for cost savings play, if you will, per se, what we're really doing is to expand our data content and our coverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/first-american-financial-corporation-faf-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"FAF 2021 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Campbell","x":"And then if you can maybe frame up the associated cost savings with each?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/first-american-financial-corporation-faf-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"Our pretax income was up 35%, driven by a lower loss rate, and we continue to drive revenue growth through our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"And the second thing I would say is we have fewer contracts in force now than we did a year ago just because of -- we've got 2 channels, the real estate channel, the direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"The real estate channel is down just like everything else, but the direct-to-consumer channel is growing, but we have fewer contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"And are poised to outperform given our unique assets and the productivity improvements we expect to achieve related to our investments in data, technology and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"So a year ago, we raised our prices in anticipation of inflation on the cost side of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q2","e":"faf","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Edward Seaton","x":"So we're sort of getting the benefit of the price increases we put in, haven't seen inflation yet on the claims side, but we feel like it's coming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2025-10-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Seaton","x":"Our pretax income was up 80%, driven by a lower loss rate, and we continue to grow our direct-to-consumer channel, which is offsetting the ongoing weakness in real estate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2025 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2025-10-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Seaton","x":"We're at the early stages of the next real estate cycle and our industry-leading investments in data, technology and AI position us to outperform as the market strengthens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/first-american-faf-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2026 Q1","e":"faf","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Mark DeVries","x":"As I know you're aware, there have been a lot of talk about new entrants leveraging AI to potentially disrupt the title insurance industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/first-american-faf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2026 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2026-10-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matt Wajner","x":"Pre-tax income was $11 million for the quarter, down 30% compared with last year, primarily attributable to higher marketing expense to drive continued growth in our direct-to-consumer sales channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/first-american-faf-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2026 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Seaton","x":"We expect further improvement, particularly as we introduce new tools in the fourth quarter to streamline the review process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/first-american-faf-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FAF 2026 Q3","e":"faf","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Wajner","x":"We recorded $8 million of one-time expenses during the quarter related to an operational restructuring and an in